Subject: [PATCH] fix(ci): Global Footer E2E gates report real breakage again

- Training: the open World command menu painted beneath the portaled
  header and guest bar (isolated route shell). The shell now rises above
  them while its drawer is open; 022 measures the layers.
- Poker Near Me: Report A Bug lost its 48px floor in #3209 (34px).
- Every page: GlobalPiPManager no longer imports LiveStreamService, so the
  LiveKit SDK (527 KB decoded) stays off pages that never stream.
- SEO kit and Video Library eyebrows no longer render under 12px.
- 05 Diamond Store: the fallback package art is the #3201 header scene.

